Built on Typst
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Typewright would not exist without Typst (https://typst.app,
https://github.com/typst/typst). The bundled helper `typst-parse` includes the
crates typst-syntax, typst-utils and typst-timing, copyright The Typst Project
Developers, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. Previews, PDF export
and printing use the Typst CLI installed on the user's machine.

